<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <title>Manuscript Submission Confirmation</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f4f4;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .container {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 25px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0px 0px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: auto;
      }
      .header {
        background-color: #d4a017;
        color: white;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
      }
      .header h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 20px;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 20px;
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #333;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .content p {
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }
      .cta-button {
        display: block;
        width: fit-content;
        margin: 20px auto;
        background: #d4a017;
        color: white;
        padding: 12px 20px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 5px;
        transition: background 0.3s ease;
      }
      .cta-button:hover {
        background: #b28e14;
      }
      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #777;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #eee;
      }
      .footer a {
        color: #d4a017;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      .footer a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        <h2>Manuscript Submission Confirmation</h2>
      </div>
      <div class='content'>
        <p>Dear <strong>{{authorName}}</strong>,</p>
        <p>Thank you for submitting your manuscript titled
          <strong>{{manuscriptTitle}}</strong>
          to SLUJST.</p>
        <p>Our editorial team is reviewing your manuscript and will notify you
          of the next steps soon. You can track the status of your submission by
          logging into your account.</p>
        <a href='https://slujst.slu.edu.ng/signin' class='cta-button'>Track
          Submission</a>
        <p>If you have any questions, feel free to contact us.</p>
        <p>Best Regards,<br /><strong>Editorial Team</strong></p>
      </div>
      <div class='footer'>
        <p>&copy;
          {{year}}
          Sule Lamido University Journal of Science and Technology. All Rights
          Reserved.</p>
        <p>For inquiries, contact
          <a href='mailto:tea@slu.edu.ng'>tea@slu.edu.ng</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>